### Netcup SCP API — Network Interfaces
# Discover interfaces, IPs, rDNS, and manage interface attributes.

### List All Interfaces
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/interfaces
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### List Interfaces (skip rDNS resolution for speed)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/interfaces?loadRdns=false
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Single Interface
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/interfaces/{{interface_mac}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Get Single Interface (with rDNS)
GET {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/interfaces/{{interface_mac}}?loadRdns=true
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Update Interface Driver (async — returns task UUID)
# Valid networkDriver values: VIRTIO, E1000, E1000E, RTL8139, VMXNET3
PUT {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/interfaces/{{interface_mac}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "driver": "VIRTIO"
}

### Create VLAN Interface (async — returns task UUID)
# Max 10 interfaces per server
# networkDriver is required: VIRTIO, E1000, E1000E, RTL8139, VMXNET3
POST {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/interfaces
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/merge-patch+json

{
  "vlanId": 0,
  "networkDriver": "VIRTIO"
}

### Delete Interface (async — returns task UUID)
DELETE {{base_url}}/servers/{{server_id}}/interfaces/REPLACE_WITH_MAC
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
